      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1862, Smith’s ranch became Smith Station, a vital stagecoach stop on the Bradshaw Trail that linked San Bernardino to Arizona.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
